1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
A local customer-support chatbot with language, sentiment, intent and RAG.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:23,000
A real tracking question is answered using retrieved support examples.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Expandable Bitext references make the retrieved context visible.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:46,000
This follow-up receives an honest fallback when the answer cannot be verified.

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Negative sentiment changes the tone and adds an attention flag, not an escalation.

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:16,000
An Arabic question receives an Arabic answer with supporting references.

7
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:25,000
The chatbot acknowledges feedback without claiming to submit a review.

8
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Human support is recommended. No transfer or store action takes place.
